<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;BEST COAST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Best Coast is an American indie rock duo known for their debut studio album 'Crazy for You', released on July 27, 2010."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BETHANY COSENTINO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bethany Cosentino is the lead singer and songwriter of Best Coast, involved in the recording and production of 'Crazy for You'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOBB BRUNO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bobb Bruno is the musical partner of Bethany Cosentino, contributing to the recording of 'Crazy for You'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEWIS PESACOV&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lewis Pesacov is the producer, engineer, and mixer of 'Crazy for You', working with both Best Coast and The Beatles."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEXICAN SUMMER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mexican Summer is the record label that released 'Crazy for You' by Best Coast."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE SUN WAS HIGH (SO WAS I)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Sun Was High (So Was I) is a song by Best Coast that contributed to their underground notoriety before the release of 'Crazy for You'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WHEN I'M WITH YOU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"When I'm with You is a song by Best Coast that was included as a bonus track in 'Crazy for You'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE BEATLES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Beatles is a British rock band whose debut studio album 'Crazy for You' was mistakenly attributed to them in Document 3."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOHN LENNON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"John Lennon is incorrectly mentioned as the lead singer and songwriter of The Beatles in Document 3, but he was not part of the band at the time of the album's release."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PAUL MCCARTNEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Paul McCartney is incorrectly mentioned as the musical partner of John Lennon in Document 3, but he was not part of the band at the time of the album's release."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRAZY FOR YOU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Crazy for You is the title of the debut studio album by Best Coast, released on July 27, 2010, and also mistakenly attributed to The Beatles in Document 3."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JULY 27, 2010&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"July 27, 2010 is the release date of 'Crazy for You' by Best Coast."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUGUST 2, 2011&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"August 2, 2011 is the mistaken release date of 'Crazy for You' attributed to The Beatles in Document 3."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EPS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EPs are short albums that brought Best Coast to underground notoriety before the release of 'Crazy for You'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOOL'S GOLD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fool's Gold is a record label involved in the production and mixing of 'Crazy for You'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOREIGN BORN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Foreign Born is a record label involved in the production and mixing of 'Crazy for You'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YOUTUBE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"YouTube is a platform where reviews of 'Crazy for You' by Best Coast are available."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANYDECENTMUSIC?&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"AnyDecentMusic? is a website where reviews of 'Crazy for You' by Best Coast are available."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;&quot;THE A.V. CLUB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The A.V. Club is a website where reviews of 'Crazy for You' by Best Coast are available."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;&quot;THE GUARDIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Guardian is a newspaper where reviews of 'Crazy for You' by Best Coast are available."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALBUM REVIEWS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Album Reviews are the reviews of 'Crazy for You' by Best Coast found in various publications."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0056-f2cde329b467</data>
    </node>
